    "text": "Good morning, world! \ud83c\udf0e\n\nWe have spectacular new high-resolution images of our home planet, all of us looking back through the Orion capsule window at our Artemis II astronauts as they continue their journey to the Moon. https://t.co/QjxGfWiRcS",
